+  Beta shows CA$99K–102K with no `salary.levels`, so nothing says the figures are per degree.
+- 7 Google postings, NVIDIA 893397830858, and Microsoft 1970393556984110:
+  - NVIDIA: five ranges for three titles shown as $127,234–368,000, "Top is 2.9× the bottom";
+  - Microsoft: an IC4 national range and an unlabelled one.
