+**SA-6 (Low): a posted minimum reads as the pay.**
+- 285 Amazon figures stated as a minimum ("The minimum gross base pay salary for this position is listed
+  below"), with `kind: 'minimum'` since fix wave 5, show a bare "€40K" with the label "One number, not a
+  range".
